{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_06",
  "title": "When the Way Out Burns",
  "storyCode": "EP-6",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "113ff7bdf6ad9542a1e39ebc85650d6f699207843b8d24f29af14aa6be8efc63",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "(Whisper) I can't believe she'd let us leave... I thought for sure we'd be tied up and handed over to the Inquisition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "(Whisper) Shh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "I know no amount of apologies will make up for your loss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "I suppose this is the end, Isidro."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "You needn't worry. I don't blame you. It's not your fault. I accepted the consequences when I made my choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "I know it was you who bore the brunt of your crew's wrath for us, and I know it was you who saved Pascuala's life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "...Maybe you could come with us."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "You would certainly be in grave danger if you stay, señora."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "Go. Weren't you discussing how you'd escape earlier? Here's your chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "I'm the leader of the fleet. I won't abandon my crew. This was my oath to Cruz, and one which I will never turn my back on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "Señora Juana... there's something I need to return to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "You can keep the clothes and the sword. Consider it payment for your troubles."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "No, not that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "What else is there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The young man reaches into his pocket, but suddenly stops. He lets out a slow breath..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And takes out the object."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "The compass? No..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "I... I don't understand. If it's undamaged, then what is that debris in the lab?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "If you haven't been repairing the compass, then what have you been doing?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "Answer me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "The destroyed compass was a replica. I never touched the original."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "Whew..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "What?! How come no one ever told me? When'd you make the switch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "I never told anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "I don't understand. Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "The Corazonix in the compass was far more complex than I expected. If I'm unable to replicate it perfectly, that means I haven't understood its true nature."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "In which case, attempting to manipulate the actual Corazonix could only lead to failure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "But I couldn't afford to fail. Your hopes, the future of the fleet, the fates of Elysium and Pascuala... all of that was on my shoulders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "So if I was doomed to fail, I thought I should at least limit the damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "That's why I tried to replicate the Corazonix. If I proved incapable of understanding it, at least you could keep the original and find a better alchemist."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "I left some of the materials you gave me behind for the fleet as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "I'm sorry. I tried."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "Isidro... is this your idea of giving it your all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "The chance of failure was at least 87%... This was the safest way I could think of."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "Are you that afraid of failure? Even if the chance of success were one in ten thousand, I would have wagered everything on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "That's not experimentation. That's gambling."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "Hah... Have you ever considered that the odds of getting a second chance might be even lower?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "Tell me, is life a gamble, or an experiment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "Weedy's on her way to pick me up. Are you coming with us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "...My journey is not yet over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "I will continue."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "What about you, Pascuala?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "Come with me. I can find a way to get you out of here, at least..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "Alright... Take care, Isidro."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "You too. Both of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "Señor Silver."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "You're willing to stay. Good, very good..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "Have you forgotten? I've got a bad leg. Can't go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "...No, I haven't. You were injured during the second raid, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "See, you have forgotten. It happened on the day of the execution. You treated the wound yourself, but it ended up infected anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "If... hypothetically... if I were a better doctor and fixed your leg then, would you have come with us now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "...I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "What were the two of you discussing? It is time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "Señor Anastasio..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "It is an honor working with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1580_1",
      "text": "Where were you, señora?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "...Saw the kids off."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1580_1",
      "text": "I did what you told me to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "...Take the crew and Nene. Lie low in the Salt Flat for a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1580_1",
      "text": "I can't leave you here by yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "This is an order, Teach."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Under the moon, Isidro walks by himself through the Salt Flat, leaving behind a trail of lonely footprints.\nHe does not know how long he has walked. The entire night, probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He feels like he has let a lot of people down, but does not know what he did wrong.\nSuddenly, he feels lonely and wishes he were with a friend. Then he realizes he just bid farewell to Elysium.\nPerhaps Weedy has already found him. Their mission would have come to a close after confirming he was safe.\nPerhaps they are discussing the journey out of the Flat and their next mission even now. As for him, he will continue his journey, alone.\nNothing wrong with that. No attachments, no responsibility."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Sailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "text": "*yawn*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Sailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "text": "Shouldn't have had those extra swigs of saltfin garum..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tired Sailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "text": "Ugh—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Merciless Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "The guards have been eliminated. Inform the Alguacil that the intel is good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Merciless Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "Prepare to advance."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "You work fast, Javier."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "...You're alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "As you can see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "You shouldn't have been left unguarded..."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Maybe because the one who should have been protecting me is standing before me now.\nPointing the blade I made for him at me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "Go on. Kill me, and the fleet is yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "Juana is in our custody. Keep an eye on her, but don't let her get hurt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "...What a joke."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Sailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "text": "How did you find this place...? Which finshit sold us out?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "Even now you think of vengeance? Meet your end, villain!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Sailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "text": "Gah—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "What of the compass? Have you learned anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "Nothing, Señor Alguacil. It's all rank-and-file thugs who can hardly string two sentences together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "We won't find anything unless we go deeper into their base."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "Do not stop without my direct command. Everything here must be cleansed with fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "There is no reason to allow such tools of sin to continue to exist."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "Sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A noise rouses Isidro from his musings and causes him to halt his steps.\nHe turns around and sees the dark night lit up on the horizon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "That's..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It is the light of a raging fire..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "No..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the direction of the fleet."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "How could it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Isidro steps forward without hesitation.\nIt is a decision made not with reason, but pure impulse.\nHe runs as if his life depends on it, retracing his old set of footprints, towards the direction that he came from.\nThat same set of footprints is no longer lonely."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "Don't bother searching. You won't find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "The sailors told me that the kid screwed up. The compass was wrecked. It'd be of no use even if you found it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "Do not think to presume whether it is of use to me or not, bandit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, perdón."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "I have safeguarded the compass for nearly a decade, and slain all who reached for it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "Even if it has become dust, I must see this dust with my own eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "Where is your leader?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "We had a deal. Juana will be spared."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "And how does your agreement with Silver concern me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "Surely the woman fled with the compass, yes? This tale of alchemical failure a ruse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "A lie... to protect a woman, for the sake of your own desires? You, too, ought to be cleansed—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "I'm not lying. Juana doesn't have the compass. Whatever's left of it is of no use to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "It's the alchemist and his lab you should be looking for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "And where might that be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "Second tent in the back row. There's a secret door leading to the lab."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "...More lies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Anastasio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "Do not make me cut you down where you stand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Javier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "On the ground! Don't move a muscle!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Desperate Sailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "text": "I-Is it true? We'll all get pardoned if you find the compass?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Desperate Sailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "text": "Are we gonna get a lighter punishment if we don't resist?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "Fools."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Desperate Sailor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "text": "Okay..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
